* device instance $3 r0 *1 26,28 NMOS
XM_ex_3 n_ex_18 A n_ex_6 VSS NMOS L=1u W=13u AS=36.4p AD=36.4p PS=31.6u PD=31.6u
* device instance $4 r0 *1 41,28 NMOS
XM_ex_4 VSS B n_ex_18 VSS NMOS L=1u W=13u AS=36.4p AD=36.4p PS=31.6u PD=31.6u
